{"n": 49, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "49.webp", "text": "0011209 REPLACING ENGINE OIL AND\nOIL FILTER\n\nUnscrew bolt (1) and take off oil filter\ncover (2) (oil runs from oil filter into oil\npan).\n\nRemove oil filter cartridge (3).\n\nRemove oil drain plug after oil in oil filter\nhousing has drained or draw out oil.\n\nInstall new oil filter cartridge.\n\nMount oil filter cover and tighten bolt with\ntotque of 30 Nm (22 ft. ibs.).\n\nPour in engine oil.\n\n‘Start and run angina at high speed (about\n2500 rpm) until oil contro! lamp goes out\n{about 5 seconds),\n\n‘Stop engine and check oll oval,\n\n11-0 162\n\n14-0 167\n\na\n\nee\n\n10 166\n\n4011 116\n\n1100039 CHECKING COMPRESSION OF\nALL CYLINDERS\n\nLift out cover and pull off master relay (1).\n\nUnscrew all spark plugs — see 12 12011.\nSerew Special Tool 11 0 166 in spark plug\ntapped bore by hand and connect compression\ntester,\n\nPress down on accelerator pedal and operate\nStarter until the compression stops rising.\n\nThe values of all cylinders should not differ by\nmore than 0.5 bar (7 psi),\n\nNominal value: 10 to 11 bar (142 to 156 psi).", "words": [["0011209", 0.2712, 0.0747, 0.3212, 0.0859], ["REPLACING", 0.3343, 0.0747, 0.397, 0.0872], ["ENGINE", 0.402, 0.0747, 0.4429, 0.0872], ["OIL", 0.447, 0.0747, 0.4662, 0.0872], ["AND", 0.4702, 0.076, 0.4944, 0.0872], ["OIL", 0.3333, 0.0912, 0.3525, 0.1018], ["FILTER", 0.3566, 0.0912, 0.396, 0.1031], ["Unscrew", 0.2692, 0.1203, 0.3111, 0.1408], ["bolt", 0.3162, 0.1203, 0.3359, 0.1408], ["(1)", 0.3394, 0.1229, 0.3525, 0.1348], ["and", 0.3566, 0.1203, 0.3727, 0.1408], ["take", 0.3773, 0.1203, 0.3949, 0.1408], ["off", 0.3995, 0.1203, 0.4131, 0.1408], ["oil", 0.4162, 0.1203, 0.4288, 0.1408], ["filter", 0.4318, 0.1229, 0.4561, 0.1348], ["cover", 0.2702, 0.1414, 0.2965, 0.1494], ["(2)", 0.3005, 0.1388, 0.3141, 0.1507], ["(oil", 0.3182, 0.1388, 0.3343, 0.1507], ["runs", 0.3374, 0.1414, 0.3576, 0.1507], ["from", 0.3606, 0.1388, 0.3838, 0.1507], ["oil", 0.3879, 0.